Package: openmediavault-frpc
Architecture: any
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0)
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault FRP client plugin
 Manage frp (frpc) reverse proxy tunnels from the OpenMediaVault web
 interface: server connection, proxies and visitors are stored in the
 OMV configuration database and rendered to frpc.toml on Apply. Two
 backends are supported - an existing Docker frpc container (default)
 or the bundled frpc binary running as a native systemd service.
 Includes start/stop/restart, hot reload, live per-proxy status, logs,
 generated-config preview and Chinese translations.
